# Which /AOK/docs page becomes which GitHub wiki page.
#
# tools/sync-wiki.py publishes opt/AOK/docs/<source> to the ish-AOK wiki as
# <Page>.md, and rewrites the docs' relative links (roots.md and friends) into
# wiki page names using this table. A doc that is not listed here is NOT
# published -- which is how docs/book/ stays out, since it is a separate tree
# with its own manifest (fs/aok-book.manifest).
#
# Page names are deliberately spelled out rather than derived. The H1 of each
# doc is a sentence -- "ktop: an htop-style process viewer that understands
# multiple guest architectures" -- and no rule that produces a good page name
# from that also produces "/AOK" from "/AOK: what it is and how it's built".
#
# Format: <source file>  <Wiki-Page-Name>
# Wiki page names use hyphens for spaces; that is GitHub's own convention and
# it is what the existing Crypto-Acceleration page already uses.

00-overview.md                 Overview
benchmarks.md                  Benchmarks
binfmt-misc.md                 binfmt_misc
crypto-accel.md                Crypto-Acceleration
file-browser.md                File-Browser
files-app-integration.md       Files-App-Integration
fuse.md                        FUSE
ktop.md                        ktop
llm-chat.md                    LLM-Chat
md.md                          md
motepad.md                     motepad
native-programs.md             Native-Programs
native-setup.md                Native-Setup
networking.md                  Networking
persist.md                     Persist
proc-ish.md                    proc-ish
riscv64-vendor-extensions.md   RISC-V-Vendor-Extensions
roots.md                       Roots
shortcuts.md                   Shortcuts
swap.md                        Swap
themes.md                      Themes
tuning-knobs.md                Tuning-Knobs
workspace.md                   Workspace
